{"id":"wb-7-558","name":"东京陵","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"东京陵","text":"东京陵，位于现今中华人民共和国辽宁省辽阳市文圣区庆阳街道东京陵村，在东京城遗址以东约1.5公里处，也曾是除了“盛京三陵”（福陵、昭陵、永陵）之外的另一处位于关外的清朝皇家陵寝。东京陵现存清太祖努尔哈赤胞弟舒尔哈齐、长子褚英、庶母弟穆尔哈齐及其子大尔差等人的三座陵园。现为中国全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%9C%E4%BA%AC%E9%99%B5","revisionId":86856272,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856272","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核百科重定向、文物名称与同一地点；引用版本已锁定","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f672e7495bbb2b68a8182309.jpg","title":"亜細亜大観_15_130_\"東京陵_（滿洲國）\".jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BA%9C%E7%B4%B0%E4%BA%9C%E5%A4%A7%E8%A6%B3_15_130_%22%E6%9D%B1%E4%BA%AC%E9%99%B5_%EF%BC%88%E6%BB%BF%E6%B4%B2%E5%9C%8B%EF%BC%89%22.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ee/%E4%BA%9C%E7%B4%B0%E4%BA%9C%E5%A4%A7%E8%A6%B3_15_130_%22%E6%9D%B1%E4%BA%AC%E9%99%B5_%EF%BC%88%E6%BB%BF%E6%B4%B2%E5%9C%8B%EF%BC%89%22.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"黑龙会","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"東京陵 （滿洲國）\n東京陵は遼陽の北、大子河の畔にある。昔し淸朝が奉天に遷都する前まで、この地に都を置いたところである。","width":320,"height":217,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图"}}